<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>HTML Formatting Tags</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Heading 1 (h1)</h1>
    <h2>Heading 2 (h2)</h2>
    <h3>Heading 3 (h3)</h3>
    <h4>Heading 4 (h4)</h4>
    <h5>Heading 5 (h5)</h5>
    <h6>Heading 6 (h6)</h6>

    <p>This is <b>bold</b> text using &lt;b&gt; tag.</p>
    <p>This is <strong>strong</strong> text using &lt;strong&gt; tag.</p>
    <p>This is <i>italic</i> text using &lt;i&gt; tag.</p>
    <p>This is <em>emphasized</em> text using &lt;em&gt; tag.</p>
    <p>This is <u>underlined</u> text using &lt;u&gt; tag.</p>
    <p>This is <mark>highlighted</mark> text using &lt;mark&gt; tag.</p>
    <p>Chemical Formula: H<sub>2</sub>O (Subscript: &lt;sub&gt;)</p>
    <p>Mathematical Formula: X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> (Superscript: &lt;sup&gt;)</p>
</body>
</html>
